notes.content:
To ensure the game's stability and enhance overall service quality and user experience, "Blood of Steel" will undergo maintenance on June 20th from 09:00 to 11:00 (UTC+8). During this period, the game world will be temporarily closed, and game matchmaking will be disabled around 08:45. Additionally, comprehensive maintenance and backup of the account database will be performed. Please notice that the maintenance time may change based on specific work conditions. We kindly ask all players to plan the game time accordingly.

Update Content:
1、New mount form [Howl Mountain Sea] temporarily available
[list]
[*] This period's rewards include the [Howl Mountain Sea mount] for Cao Cao, Guan Yu, Alexander, Arthur, and Catherine, along with Credit, Battle Pass Token, Diamond, and Shard of Skin rewards;
[*] The [Howl Mountain Sea Blind Box] is permanently limited to 60 draws, and guarantees all rewards in the box after 60 draws;
[*]Guaranteed [Howl Mountain Sea Random Chest]* 1 on the 10th, 20th, 40th, and 60th draws, and guaranteed [Howl Mountain Sea Self-Selected Chest]* 1 on the 30th draw;
[*] Collecting 3 or 5 [Howl Mountain Sea mounts] activates corresponding advanced effects;
[*] You can draw the [Howl Mountain Sea Blind Box] under [Store – Skin] by spending Credits.
[/list]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/36188276/2b7289adae6014d6ad52210cee7b1c85b359d510.png[/img]

2、Phase 2 of contract weapons now available, with this phase's theme being [The Firmament]
[list]
[*] After purchasing Iron Armor Plus, players may receive the current period's contract token [The Firmament] during battle settlements (with a weekly cap of 2 drops and a drop rate of 30%), while the previous period's contract token [Immortalized Light] will become a rare drop (with a 1% chance of being a rare drop during this drop event);
[*] Epic red contract weapons: In addition to the original trajectory lines and weapon activation effects, each weapon now includes a custom execution move and a finale interaction animation (the finale interaction is common to each art style series, with the Immortalized Light and The Firmament boxes' red weapons belonging to the [Ethereal] series, and a style series prefix added to the weapon name). Red weapons in Immortalized Light have also supplemented their corresponding performances;
[*] Legendary rewards [Mysterious chest] now include the footprint [Blazing Fire];
[*] Players can obtain general weapons and other items by signing contracts using silver to obtain contract keys in the contract system;
[*] Players in the contract system can use lower-level general weapons to synthesize higher-level general weapons, and support cross-contract item revision synthesis. For example, in cross-contract revision synthesis, if 10 materials include 3 from Contract A and 7 from Contract B, the synthesis result has a 30% chance to produce a higher-level item from Contract A and a 70% chance to produce a higher-level item from Contract B.
[/list]
3、Profit Store Skin Exchange Rotation Update

4、Path of Heroes reward levels expanded to Level 800

5、From the [Peerless Beauty Blind Box], Zhang Xingcai's collectible skin [Qi Luo Xiang] supports mixing and matching of long and short skirts. After this maintenance, we will send accessories: Qiluo Skirt and Qiluo Skirt - Qixiang Curtain, via mail to players who have already obtained [Qi Luo Xiang]. Players who acquire this skin later will receive these accessories uniformly on June 27th.

6、Fixed an issue where Helen's soldiers would not actively use melee attacks during the 20s duration after using the [Supplementary Spear Throwing] skill.

7、Fixed a bug that caused players to be unable to walk or turn normally after certain actions led to a key stuck.

To ensure the stability of the game operation, improve the overall service quality and experience, <Blood of Steel> will be updated and maintained from 09:00 to 11:00 (UTC+8) on September 12, during which the game world will be closed, and the game matching will be closed around 08:45 and unable to log in. In addition, a comprehensive maintenance and backup of the account database will be carried out to ensure the stable and smooth operation of the server! There is no possibility of opening earlier or later due to the specific work situation. Please arrange your time reasonably.

[b]Efficiency Optimization[/b]
[olist]
[*] Optimize the storage of client art resources and reduce the local storage occupancy of the client;
[/olist]

[b]Competitive Mode[/b]
[olist]
[*] Optimize the situation where infantry sometimes flicker abnormally in the battlefield;
[*] Fix the BUG of Zhao Yun’s awakening skin texture disorder;
[/olist]

[b]Merge[/b]
In order to provide a better battlefield environment for the lords of North America and South America, and further promote server activity. We decided to conduct merge from 09:00 to 15:00 (UTC+8) on September 12. After the merge of North America and South America regions, the generals in the corresponding regions can communicate and fight in the same channel, and experience the game fun together. After this maintenance is over:
[olist]
[*] The Territory War event will be settled in advance, and the current season rewards will be issued; and reset the current season;
[*] The data of South America’s Vertical and Horizontal World event will be cleared (retaining alliance data);
[*] After merge, if there is a duplicate situation in the lord’s name, you will get an extra chance to change your name;
[*] After merge, if there is a duplicate situation in the guild name or team name, you can contact customer service for modification (bos@ycgame.com);
[*] After merge, South America’s time zone will be adjusted to UTC-6;
[*] The ranking list data will merge and display the ranking data of North America and South America regions;
[*] After merge, the login entrance remains unchanged, and the lord can continue to log in from the original region entrance. 
[/olist]

Due to the long maintenance time, we will issue: Silver Coins5000, Diamonds500, Skin Fragments*3 to players affected by this merger.

Thank you for your long-term attention and support for our game.
